<Guest title="House Awareness">
  <p>Understanding the cabin's features and layout will help ensure a comfortable stay.</p>

  <h2>Layout</h2>

  <h3>Main Floor</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Living room:</strong> open-concept with gas fireplace</li>
    <li><strong>Kitchen:</strong> fully equipped with modern appliances</li>
    <li><strong>Dining:</strong> seating for seven at the table plus two at the bar</li>
    <li><strong>Primary bedroom:</strong> King bed with en-suite bathroom and walk-in shower</li>
    <li><strong>Covered patio:</strong> furnished, with the private hot tub</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Upstairs</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Bedroom 2:</strong> Queen · shared Jack-and-Jill bath with combination tub/shower</li>
    <li><strong>Bedroom 3:</strong> King · shared Jack-and-Jill bath with combination tub/shower</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Mother-in-Law Suite (above the garage)</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Bunk room:</strong> two twin-over-full bunk beds plus a full sleeper sofa (sleeps five)</li>
    <li><strong>Private bathroom</strong> with combination tub/shower</li>
    <li><strong>Kitchenette</strong> with dining for four</li>
    <li><strong>TV lounge</strong> with cheerful kid-themed décor</li>
  </ul>

